  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "story_2247_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "О́дин муж проходи́л чрез за́нятый вокза́л, когда́ он уви́дел осо́бу с неправоспосо́бностью, продаю́щую предме́ты.",
      "text_en": "A man was passing through a busy train station when he saw a person with a disability selling things.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ódin\" data-defn=\"один\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">О́дин</span><rt>Ódin</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"muzh\" data-defn=\"муж\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">муж</span><rt>muzh</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"prokhodíl\" data-defn=\"проходил\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">проходи́л</span><rt>prokhodíl</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chrez\" data-defn=\"чрез\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">чрез</span><rt>chrez</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zányatyy\" data-defn=\"занятый\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">за́нятый</span><rt>zányatyy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vokzál\" data-defn=\"вокзал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">вокза́л</span><rt>vokzál</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kogdá\" data-defn=\"когда\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">когда́</span><rt>kogdá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"on\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">он</span><rt>on</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"uvídel\" data-defn=\"увидел\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">уви́дел</span><rt>uvídel</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"osóbu\" data-defn=\"особу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">осо́бу</span><rt>osóbu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nepravosposóbnost&#x27;yu\" data-defn=\"неправоспособностью\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">неправоспосо́бностью</span><rt>nepravosposóbnost&#x27;yu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"prodayúshchuyu\" data-defn=\"продающую\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">продаю́щую</span><rt>prodayúshchuyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"predméty\" data-defn=\"предметы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">предме́ты</span><rt>predméty</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Ódin muzh prokhodíl chrez zányatyy vokzál, kogdá on uvídel osóbu s nepravosposóbnost'yu, prodayúshchuyu predméty.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.58,
      "duration": 5.58
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2247_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Он слу́чайно уро́нил со́тню юа́нь пе́ред ним.",
      "text_en": "He casually dropped a hundred yuan in front of him.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"On\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Он</span><rt>On</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"slúchayno\" data-defn=\"случайно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">слу́чайно</span><rt>slúchayno</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"urónil\" data-defn=\"уронил\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">уро́нил</span><rt>urónil</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sótnyu\" data-defn=\"сотню\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">со́тню</span><rt>sótnyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yuán&#x27;\" data-defn=\"юань\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">юа́нь</span><rt>yuán&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péred\" data-defn=\"перед\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пе́ред</span><rt>péred</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nim\" data-defn=\"ним\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ним</span><rt>nim</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "On slúchayno urónil sótnyu yuán' péred nim.",
      "start": 5.93,
      "end": 8.24,
      "duration": 2.31
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2247_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Долгими́ не бы́ли хлопоты, как он верну́лся и извиня́лся: \"Мне жаль.",
      "text_en": "Before long, though, he came back and apologized: “I’m sorry.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Dolgimí\" data-defn=\"долгими\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Долгими́</span><rt>Dolgimí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"býli\" data-defn=\"были\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бы́ли</span><rt>býli</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"khlopoty\" data-defn=\"хлопоты\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">хлопоты</span><rt>khlopoty</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"on\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">он</span><rt>on</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vernúlsya\" data-defn=\"вернулся\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">верну́лся</span><rt>vernúlsya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"izvinyálsya\" data-defn=\"извинялся\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">извиня́лся</span><rt>izvinyálsya</rt></ruby>: \"<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Mne\" data-defn=\"мне\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Мне</span><rt>Mne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhal&#x27;\" data-defn=\"жаль\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">жаль</span><rt>zhal&#x27;</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Dolgimí ne býli khlopoty, kak on vernúlsya i izvinyálsya: \"Mne zhal'.",
      "start": 8.59,
      "end": 12.8,
      "duration": 4.21
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2247_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Ты бизнесме́н, а я обошёлся с тобо́й, как с нищебро́дом.\"",
      "text_en": "You’re a businessperson, but I treated you like a beggar.”",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ty\" data-defn=\"ты\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Ты</span><rt>Ty</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"biznesmén\" data-defn=\"бизнесмен\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бизнесме́н</span><rt>biznesmén</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"a\" data-defn=\"а\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">а</span><rt>a</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"oboshyolsya\" data-defn=\"обошёлся\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">обошёлся</span><rt>oboshyolsya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tobóy\" data-defn=\"тобой\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">тобо́й</span><rt>tobóy</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nishchebródom\" data-defn=\"нищебродом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">нищебро́дом</span><rt>nishchebródom</rt></ruby>.\"",
      "transliteration": "Ty biznesmén, a ya oboshyolsya s tobóy, kak s nishchebródom.\"",
      "start": 13.15,
      "end": 16.41,
      "duration": 3.26
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2247_p1_c0",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Через какóе-то вре́мя муж про́шёл через вокза́л снова́.",
      "text_en": "Some time later, the man passed through the station again.",
