      "ruby": "\"<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nadéyalsya\" data-defn=\"надеялся\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">наде́ялся</span><rt>nadéyalsya</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"uvizhu\" data-defn=\"увижу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">увижу</span><rt>uvizhu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tebyá\" data-defn=\"тебя\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">тебя́</span><rt>tebyá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"snova\" data-defn=\"снова\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">снова</span><rt>snova</rt></ruby>,\" <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"skázal\" data-defn=\"сказал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ска́зал</span><rt>skázal</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tot\" data-defn=\"тот\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">тот</span><rt>tot</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kogo\" data-defn=\"кого\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">кого</span><rt>kogo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"on\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">он</span><rt>on</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"raneé\" data-defn=\"ранее\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ранее́</span><rt>raneé</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vstrechál\" data-defn=\"встречал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">встреча́л</span><rt>vstrechál</rt></ruby>.",
